      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My typical use scenarios in VR:\n\n- Share a URL to a VRChat Feedback topic to explain a bug. (Trusted URL)\n\n- Share a URL to a shared file on an external platform, to share a private avatar prefab with fixes. (Untrusted URL)\n\n- Share a URL to a BOOTH asset / product page. (Trusted URL?)\n\n- ...sharing an URL to this feature request.\n\nThe other use scenarios typically drive me to go share an URL off platform if it's not a social profile link, or abuse social links in profile.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
