      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One potential issue I see with this is an user sharing an URL to a private VRChat API endpoint and then getting banned for accessing it, or doing an unwanted action resulting in data modification.\n\nI think VRChat API URLs should be blocklisted in this sharing feature.",
